Subject: SSR Plus retain node references across native SS password correction

Match only exact historical r9 native Base64 SS hash identities within their
subscription group. Keep the original SID and all its references while writing
the corrected literal password through the existing transaction journal.
Reject ambiguous plans before staging writes. Historical JSON incompatibility
only disables that compatibility match and never rejects a valid current node.

